>greet_prog 100~
  if quest (15,3,$n) == 1
    say I wish I hadn't left my mirror in my tent.
  endif
~
>rand_prog 15~
  mpecho $I runs her finger across her chin.
~
>give_prog i37208~
  if quest (15,3,$n) == 1
    say Hey, you've been in my... Oh, it is you.
    say Word has gotten around that you are helping
    say the manager.  Even so, it isn't nice to go
    say into a person's tent.  I guess I can overlook
    say it this time.
    mpoload 37285
    say Here, take this, The manager wanted me to give
    say this to you if I saw you.
    give i37285 $n
    mpmset $n quest 15 3 2
    mpjunk i37208
    break
  endif
  say Hey, you've been in my tent.  What gives
  say you the right to go through my things.
  say You better hope nothing is missing.
  say Now I have to go put this back.  You
  say should go talk to the festival manager.
  mpjunk i37208
~
|

