E
ball~
This small ball is used in the festival's Dunk the Clown game.  You get
five throws and must hit the clown three times.
You can begin a new {130}game{300} or {130}throw{300} the ball.~
P 1
TRIG_COMMAND 100 throw
  OPROG_IF OIF_USER_ROOM_NUM = 37454 2 30      

P 2
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_OBJECT_QUEST_IF 0 3 > 0 4 3

P 3
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_JUNK

P 4
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_QUEST_ADD 0 3 -1
  
P 4
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_IF OIF_RANDOM_PERCENT > 60 5 10

P 5
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
    mpechoat $ You throw the ball...
    mpechoat $ You hit the target dead center.
~

P 5
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_OBJECT_QUEST_IF 4 3 = 2 17 15

P 10
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
    mpechoat $ You throw the ball...
    mpechoat $ You miss the target entirely.
~

P 15
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_QUEST_ADD 4 3 1


P 17
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
    kill clown
~

P 17
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_JUNK

P 20
TRIG_UNKNOWN 100 game
  OPROG_OBJECT_QUEST_IF 0 3 > 0 21 22
  
P 21
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
    mpechoat $ You have turns left on this ball.
~	 

P 22
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
    mpechoat $ You begin a new game.
~

P 22
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_QUEST_SET 0 3 5	

   
P 30
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
    mpechoat $ There is nothing to throw at here.
~
    
